  "notes": [
    "Edge runtime: the container `supabase functions serve` creates (same image, command, mounts, env; default per_worker policy), started per run without the CLI file watcher. With NTFS last-access updates enabled, the watcher fired on worker boots and restarted the runtime mid-run, killing every open stream.",
